1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:12,090
2 ways to check prices at Talented Education Group: in the app, or in your browser via the link below this video.

2
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:25,680
Way 1: the Talented app – free, no Play Store or App Store needed.

3
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:34,520
Open the price list on your phone and tap "Pasang Aplikasi Talented" (Install the Talented app) below the tutorial video.

4
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:52,910
Android: in Chrome tap Install, or use the three-dot menu → "Install app" / "Add to Home screen".

5
00:00:53,510 --> 00:01:07,050
iPhone/iPad: in Safari tap Share → "Add to Home Screen" → "Add".

6
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:18,810
Done! The Talented icon is now on your home screen.

7
00:01:19,410 --> 00:01:32,850
Way 2: your browser – click the link below this video.

8
00:01:33,450 --> 00:01:53,690
Open the price list page and pick your language at the top right – 15 languages. Below it is this tutorial video with a chapter list.

9
00:01:54,290 --> 00:02:11,690
The menu: programmes, English, pathways, other schools, IELTS/PTE/Korean/Japanese classes, scholarships, jobs, accommodation and start your application.

10
00:02:12,290 --> 00:02:28,640
Buttons to install the Talented app and check prices now, plus TEG event videos: info sessions, seminars and school expos.

11
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:47,200
Choose your country – Australia, New Zealand and many more – then Offshore (still in Indonesia) or Onshore (already there).

12
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:57,020
Search by course or school, then filter by city, field and level.

13
00:02:57,620 --> 00:03:05,660
Pick your OSHC provider – insurance costs are recalculated for every result.

14
00:03:06,260 --> 00:03:17,090
Sort by cheapest, upfront cost, total study cost, recommended bank balance, A–Z or duration.

15
00:03:17,690 --> 00:03:28,490
Each card shows upfront cost, total study cost and recommended bank balance, with an IDR estimate.

16
00:03:29,090 --> 00:03:39,750
Open Programme details to see tuition per period, material and enrolment fees, and the upfront periods.

17
00:03:40,350 --> 00:03:52,310
Upfront cost, minimum bank balance for the visa, and a refund policy summary with its official source.

18
00:03:52,910 --> 00:04:07,510
Tick “Add estimated living costs” to include living costs for the whole study period in the total.

19
00:04:08,110 --> 00:04:19,540
Download a PDF or send it to WhatsApp; Start your application and Ask a consultant are on every card.

20
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:31,500
Tick Compare on two or more programmes, then click Compare selected programmes.

21
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:44,850
Save all results as a PDF, only your ticked programmes, or send the list to WhatsApp.

22
00:04:45,450 --> 00:05:00,450
English (ELICOS): weekly fees with a 10-week simulation of upfront cost, total cost and recommended balance.

23
00:05:01,050 --> 00:05:19,100
Pathway packages: VET at one school, then a Bachelor at another, with upfront cost, total and recommended balance.

24
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:33,580
Other schools: the official CRICOS directory – 1,539 schools with courses and indicative prices.

25
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:47,860
IELTS/PTE preparation with Victory Scholars Academy – TEG is a Pearson PTE Elite Partner 2026.

26
00:05:48,460 --> 00:06:00,080
Basic English, PTE Foundation, IELTS/PTE Preparation, Japanese and Korean – online and offline, priced in IDR.

27
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:22,360
Scholarships: active scholarships for Indonesian students – filter by country, level, provider and funding, or TEG partner campuses. Always check the official source.

28
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:38,160
Jobs from Jobs by Adzuna, checked twice a day. Never pay to get a job.

29
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:58,900
Accommodation: student housing providers with price ranges. Never transfer money before an official contract.

30
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:09,220
Start your application: document checklist, process steps and a student visa process video.

31
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:23,720
Our offices in Sydney, Pontianak and Singkawang, and the Student Information Form (PDF/Excel).

32
00:07:24,320 --> 00:07:38,560
All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's official offer letter.
